---
<section id="top" class="hero mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-[5.3%_52.7%_29.4%_12.6%] border-b border-[#bdc7d2] bg-white [min-height:min(50vw,720px)]">
  <div class="hero-rail flex flex-col items-center gap-7 border-r border-[#bdc7d2] px-0 py-8 max-md:row-span-2 max-md:gap-[18px] max-md:py-6" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-rail-label">WEB DEVELOPMENT</span><i class="hero-rail-line"></i><span class="hero-rail-label">SCROLL</span><i class="hero-rail-line"></i></div>
  <div class="hero-copy min-w-0 self-center px-[3.8%] py-[clamp(48px,7vw,100px)]">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow font-raleway text-[clamp(10px,1.15vw,15px)] font-semibold tracking-[.07em]">WEB DEVELOPMENT PARTNER</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title mb-6 mt-7 text-[clamp(28px,4.3vw,60px)] font-extrabold leading-[1.4] tracking-[-.055em] max-md:text-[clamp(22px,6.2vw,40px)] max-md:leading-[1.5]"><span class="whitespace-nowrap">必要なところに入り、</span><br /><span class="whitespace-nowrap">Web開発を前へ。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description mt-4 text-[clamp(12px,1.3vw,17px)] leading-[1.9] text-[#394452] max-md:text-[13px]">制作会社・広告代理店・個人事業主のWeb制作や開発を、<br class="desktop-break" />スポットで支援します。フロントエンド実装からAPI・バックエンド開発まで、必要な範囲を横断して対応します。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions mt-7 flex gap-4 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-2.5"><a class="design-button focus-ring primary inline-flex min-h-[54px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-[22px] border border-[#e83f93] bg-[#e83f93] px-3 text-[clamp(11px,1.2vw,15px)] font-bold transition hover:bg-[#cc2879] max-md:text-[13px]" href="#contact">仕事を相談する <span aria-hidden="true">⟶</span></a><a class="design-button focus-ring inline-flex min-h-[54px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-[22px] border border-[#687589] bg-white px-3 text-[clamp(11px,1.2vw,15px)] font-bold transition hover:bg-[#f3f5f7] max-md:text-[13px]" href="#works">制作・開発実績を見る <span aria-hidden="true">⟶</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafb] max-md:col-start-2 max-md:h-[230px] max-md:border-t max-md:border-[#bdc7d2]" aria-hidden="true"><img class="hero-art-image max-md:object-cover max-md:object-[center_55%]" src="/assets/images/hero-grid.svg" width="238" height="404" alt="" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
  <div class="hero-side" aria-hidden="true"><p>CODE<br />CONNECT<br />CREATE<br />TOGETHER</p><i class="short-line"></i><i class="long-line"></i><p class="hero-signature">WEB<br />DEVELOPMENT</p></div>
</section>
<style>
.hero{--hero-progress:0;--hero-shift:0px}
.hero-rail-label{writing-mode:vertical-rl;font:600 10px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em}.hero-rail-line{width:1px;background:#8c99ab;flex:1}.hero-rail-line:last-child{flex:0 0 40px}
.hero-art-image{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:fill;transform:translateY(calc(var(--hero-shift) * -.55)) scale(calc(1 + var(--hero-progress) * .055));transition:transform .08s linear}.hero-side{padding:32px 22%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;font:600 clamp(9px,1.05vw,13px)/1.35 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em}.short-line{width:30px;height:1px;background:#8190a3;margin:14px 0 35px}.long-line{width:1px;flex:1;background:#8190a3;margin-left:30px;margin-bottom:45px}.hero-signature{font-size:10px}
@media(max-width:767px){.hero{grid-template-columns:24px 1fr 24px;min-height:0}.hero-side{display:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hero-art-image{transform:none;transition:none}}
</style>
